Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my\Nstruggles shoot me through the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pity if we\Nlingered here and let our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sparks of life\Nblend aloud and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves\Ncast, my heart exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been your kindness and your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor, ride as high as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure I don't need anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I go fast as I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're dashing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're never gonna fall, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world may now be my enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Water swirls, but I ain't\Nbacking down so long as I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'll give it. Come\Nround the current with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite our best efforts,\NNika has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And two emperors of the sea\Nhave fallen simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to conceal this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, the news will\Nspread across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The timing couldn't be any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to act now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What of zeal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that the island disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it walked away slowly into fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't going to open the borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Guano will remain an iron-tight fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems they gauged the\Nsituation and changed plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's in charge now is no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And any hope we had of sending in a\Nbattalion has been completely dashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you at least bring her to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit me zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jamming shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've screwed up enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to clean up your mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As news spreads of Kaido's defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the land of Wano rejoices after facing\N20 years of tyranny and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a marine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like hell. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you could spare\Nyourself by joining Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, too bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet on the wrong horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I bowed to Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When I saw that monster, I\Nknew he could crush me at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid and killer, on the other\Nhand, show no fear at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They stared death right in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I'd foreseen the truth\Nthat they would win in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't face them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a traitor and a coward
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so I wasn't destined to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your prediction was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did someone else only have a 1% chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making a fall of me, stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows some and\NI don't get hungry! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take down the fire\Nfestival decorations just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the Shogun, has decreed\Nthat we'll have another celebration!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There have been some changes, so\Nstarting today, I'll be your new teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen to Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarahebi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she was fun, I'm afraid that\Neverything she taught you was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you about the land of\NWano's true heroes from the very start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The first hero
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,we're going to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.93,0:06:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,about is a man named Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he was even a year\Nold, he sent his nanny flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.22,0:06:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When he was four, he knocked out a bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, that was a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that Lady Komurasaki, the\Nmost beautiful woman in the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,was Lord Oten's daughter,\Nand we never knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Saved from a burning castle by\Nthe loyal samurai, Sir Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:07:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful tale\Nof courage and loyalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of loyal samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Denjiro of the Akazaya 9 disguised\Nhimself as a Yakuza to stay by her side?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling himself Kyoshiro, he\Nprotected her all those years!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone know who took\Ndown Kaido in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was someone named\NJoy Boy from what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he already left the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a hero, just like\Nthe God of the Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to build temples?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ones like Ryuma's gravesite,\Nstarting with one dedicated to Lord Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,on a hill overlooking the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll build more near it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,one for Sir Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and then ones for each\Nof the other daimyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:08:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,For Ashida and Izo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Honimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bah bah bah bah bah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That tickles, you little rascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see you're alive and well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This reminds me of old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll always be our comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought for this country, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When our time comes, we'll be laid\Nto rest right next to Izo and Ashita.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll bury Izo here, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Izo's home, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's what he would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe,\Nbut I survived again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems we did as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'm happy to see this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it won't feel right if\Nthe ones who saved us die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My purpose has been fulfilled,\Nbut they can do so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke! Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy, Taro, and Zorojuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Taro, and Zorojuro are awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still quite the\Ntomboy, it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring! Boos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you're awake, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay, and I'm so\Nglad! How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you sleep well too soon\Nto drink that much food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let the men celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally time to\Nget this party started!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, yes, but not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't spoil your appetite, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire country has been\Nplanning a banquet in your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall have it today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all cool and grown up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your new body looks pretty strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Must take after Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me punch you and see. Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those brutes are bullying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Make them all go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only eight years old, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it hurts. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, he's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He can take a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.42,0:11:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the world of\Nadults, Momo. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That baby face can't\Nprotect you now, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you look more like your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a kid, don't put trace\Non my head every time you see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have your parents to thank\Nfor that strong, sturdy body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a little time and you'll be the\Nfinest Samurai in the country. I shall try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work hard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Yamato, we should\Ntake a bath before the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your prayer was answered, so you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prayer? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a custom in Wano where you make a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,wish and give something\Nup until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it as a way to show\Nthe gods your sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you two to get further,\Nso until that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I go out taking baths and eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Yamabro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me heal right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So thoughtful, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.14,0:12:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of baths, how\Nthe heck am I so clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.22,0:13:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because I wiped you\Ndown myself from head to toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that pleases you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosshead, I think we\Nneed to have a talk. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the battle, there's a chance\NI might not be in my right mind anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If that happens, then kill me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I crawled back from the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All so I could kill you, cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it worked out, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of looks like you lost\Nyour mind a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you drive me crazy,\Nlike you would any sane person!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who crawled back from hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There they go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mixed bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I'd love\Nto accompany you. Hmm? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Back in time! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Yamato, are you sure you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing better than sharing\Na nice bath with your friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, except sharing a feast, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a bath, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can be as\Nbewitching as you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so warm and steamy! It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to bathe like this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With Lord Odin and the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're the only men I've ever\Nfelt comfortable bathing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You look exactly the same as you did then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange to think\NI'm older than you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This sure feels nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really, really nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They said the banquet is today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the revival of the Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let all the Regents know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonny's looking spiffy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we can take\Noff as soon as we like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking good too, General Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, can we get a giant robot too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't get too cozy if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know what might\Nhappen before we set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure information leaked out somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so the press probably\Nknows what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With two emperors out of the picture, we'll\Nbe the prime candidates to replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This country may isolate\Nus from our enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but we don't know what\Nthey're plotting now either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet the bounties for\Nour captains went up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes me feel cool,\Nbut it's also scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The bounties went up, sure enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know who leaked the\Ninfo, though. Oh, Pooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with us, you jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know you leaked it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I left the news out, but\NI let some news in, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh off the presses, brand spanking new\Nbounties, as well as some familiar faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,who have just been dubbed\Nemperors of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked where you are right now, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:16:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Sakazuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The air over what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can see the land of\NWano from here, if that helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Riyakukyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I do.
